$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (S)-2-(4-((2-Chloro-4-fluorophenyl)thio)phenyl)-1,1,1-trifluoropropan-2-ol
(16). A flask was charged with 15 (2.72 g, 12.23 mmol, 1.0 equiv), 1.82 g
2-chloro-1,4-difluorobenzene (12.23 mmol, 1.0 equiv), 4.98 g cesium
carbonate (15.29 mmol, 1.25 equiv) and 20 mL DMF. The flask was equipped
with a reflux condenser, and then placed into a preheated 110 °C bath
with stirring for 1 h under dry N2 atmosphere. The resulting suspension
was cooled, diluted with H2O and extracted with 50% EtOAc/ Et2O. The
organic was washed with brine, dried with Na2SO4 and concentrated under
reduced pressure. Purification of the residue by flash chromatography
(SiO2, 20% EtOAc/Hexane). White solid, yield 90.4 mmol, 74%. 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3 ): δ 7.57 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 7.43 (m, 1 H), 7.33 (d, J = 8.4
Hz, 2H), 7.25 (m, 1 H), 7.00 (m, 1H), 2.5 (s, 1 H), 1.60 (s, 3H).
