$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for the Intra and
Intermolecular C-S bond formation: An oven-dried flask was charged with
CuI (5 mol %), L5 (10 mol %), dithiocarbamate (1 mmol), iodobenzene (1.1
equiv), K2CO3 (3 equiv), and solvent DMSO (1 mL). The flask was kept in a
pre-heated oil bath at 90 oC. Heating was continued for 4 hrs after which
the reaction mixture was cooled and admixed with water (5 mL). The
product was extracted with ethylacetate (2 x 10 mL), organic layer dried
over anh.Na2SO4, concentrated under reduced pressure, and purified over
column of silica gel (EtOAc: Hexane as eluents) to give product 1a in 86
% isolated yield. The identity and purity of the products were confirmed
by spectroscopic analysis. 2-(Phenylthio)benzo[d]thiazole or
2-Phenylsulfanyl-benzothiazole (1a).
5,6-Dimethyl-2-(2-nitro-phenylsulfanyl)-benzothiazole (6e): Mp 163-165
°C, 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 2.40 (s, 3H), 2.41 (s, 3H), 7.33 (m, 2H),
7.43 (m, 1H), 7.62 (s, 1H), 7.86 (s, 1H), 8.20 (dd, 1H, J1 = 1.6 Hz, J2 =
1.6 Hz). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 20.4, 20.5, 121.5, 123.8, 125.8,
127.2, 130.1, 134.1, 134.6, 135.5, 136.5, 146.2, 152.7, 158.7. IR (KBr):
2915, 2846, 1591, 1515, 1455, 1340, 1306, 1256, 1040, 978, 856, 740, 714
cm-1. Anal. Calcd for C15H12N2O2S2 (316.40): C 56.94, H 3.82, N 8.85, S
20.27; found C 56.98, H, 3.79, N 8.87, S 20.20.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Intra- and Intermolecular C-S Bond Formation Using a Single Catalytic
System: First Direct Access to Arylthiobenzothiazoles
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Murru, Siva; Ghosh, Harisadhan; Sahoo, Santosh K.; Patel, Bhisma K.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2009), 11(19), 4254-4257

